Extract CPU load from the cpuload field and calculate memory usage using the formula (totalram - freeram) / totalram Ã— 100.', 'Resource usage (CPU and memory) should be within the expected limits after killing the application. No unexpected resource spikes should be observed.', 'd389bda0-dde2-4412-8305-4c6c28f54c19', '2026-07-01 10:04:40.350858', '2026-07-01 10:04:40.350859');
