2.Retrieve the NATIVE_PLAYBACK_CHECK_AV_STATUS, NATIVE_PLAYBACK_MEDIAPLAYBACK_TIMEOUT, NATIVE_PLAYBACK_UNDERFLOW_AUDIO_END_POINT and NATIVE_PLAYBACK_UNDERFLOW_AUDIO_START_POINT config values from Device config file.
