2. Set the application URL in WebkitBrowser app
3. Play and pause the video from the application
4.Check for any crashes during playback', 'video playback should happen with out crash', '005fa372-5b9c-476d-9fc8-2bc402e51b1b', '2026-07-01 07:17:23.260567', '2026-07-01 07:17:23.260568');
